Catatan internal tidak ditampilkan kepada penulis.</p><div class="jp-edit-buttons"><button class="jp-button" type="submit">Simpan Perubahan</button><button class="jp-button jp-button-secondary jp-edit-cancel" type="button" data-edit-id="jp-edit-{$record->payment_id|escape}">Batal</button></div></form>
							</section>
						</td>
					</tr>
				{/foreach}
				</tbody>
